  "description": "Database.Execute without options of UPDATE T SET V = V + 100 WHERE V BETWEEN 10 AND 1000 over the indexed V (values 10,20,20,30, the moved values stay in range), then UPDATE T SET V = V - 105 WHERE V >= 5, then UPDATE T2 SET V = V + 10 WHERE V BETWEEN 20 AND 30 at the range bounds. Asks the RecordsAffected and final V of every row after each statement, which tell whether a row is revisited after its key moves.",
